      "writtenOn": "2022-09-22T15:21:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it\u0027s not explicitly needed, but without it we get CRC changes to the cgroup-related hook functions. if the KMI weren\u0027t frozen, this would not be needed. The dependency came from the inclusion of include/trace/hooks/gpiolib.h in drivers/android/vendor_hooks.c. When moved to the new kernel/cgroup/vendor_hooks.c, this was needed to preserve CRC",
      "parentUuid": "04943f76_7eb28a60",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "c66b0fcdab4116cd1a58f82db967dab9ccc6461e",
